sequenceDiagram
    actor Leader as Leadership / Management
    participant FE as Frontend (React)
    participant BE as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as Database (Aiven MySQL via Prisma)

    Note over Leader,DB: Dashboard view
    Leader->>FE: Open Leadership Dashboard
    FE->>BE: GET /api/leadership/summary
    BE->>DB: Aggregate counts -- open vacancies, candidates per stage, time-to-hire, per department
    BE-->>FE: 200 summary metrics
    FE-->>Leader: Render charts and KPI tiles

    Note over Leader,DB: Exporting a PDF report
    Leader->>FE: Click "Export Report"
    FE->>BE: GET /api/leadership/report.pdf
    BE->>DB: Re-run the same aggregation queries used for the dashboard
    BE->>BE: getReportPdf() -- render metrics into a PDF document
    BE-->>FE: 200 PDF file stream
    FE-->>Leader: Browser downloads/opens the PDF
